sequence-diagram

colorMode pastel
styleMode plain
typeface clean

Staff_User [label: "NICU staff", icon: user] > Browser [label: "NeoFeed PWA", icon: monitor]: Open NeoFeed
Browser > GitHub_Pages [label: "GitHub Pages", icon: server]: Load index.html, CSS, and scripts
GitHub_Pages > Browser: Return static application

alt [label: "Gmail or Workspace login"] {
  Browser > Google_Identity [label: "Google Identity"]: Request ID token
  Google_Identity > Browser: Return ID token
  Browser > GAS_API [label: "Apps Script API", icon: server]: login with googleToken
  GAS_API > Google_Tokeninfo [label: "Google tokeninfo"]: Verify signature context and audience
  Google_Tokeninfo > GAS_API: Return verified email
}
else [label: "Non-Google email login"] {
  Browser > GAS_API: login with email and password
  GAS_API > Staff_Sheet [label: "Staff sheet", icon: database]: Read active account, salt, and password hash
  Staff_Sheet > GAS_API: Return account and role
}

GAS_API > Staff_Sheet: Resolve active account, role, and forced-change flag
GAS_API > Session_Cache [label: "CacheService", icon: database]: Create 6-hour session token
GAS_API > Browser: Return token, role, and mustChangePassword

alt [label: "Temporary password must be replaced"] {
  Browser > GAS_API: changePassword with old and new password
  GAS_API > Staff_Sheet: Store new hash and clear temporary-password fields
  GAS_API > User_Epoch [label: "PropertiesService", icon: key]: Increment user epoch
  GAS_API > Session_Cache: Rotate current-device token
  GAS_API > Browser: Return fresh token
}
else [label: "Established account"] {
  Browser > GAS_API: getActivePatients with session token
  GAS_API > Session_Cache: Verify token and sliding TTL
  GAS_API > Staff_Sheet: Recheck active account, role, and forced-change flag
  GAS_API > Patient_Registry [label: "Patient_Registry", icon: database]: Read patient records
  GAS_API > Daily_Log [label: "Daily_Log", icon: database]: Read and normalize nutrition entries
  GAS_API > Audit_Log [label: "Audit_Log", icon: database]: Append readRegistry event
  GAS_API > Browser: Return patients, logs, and synchronization timestamp
}

Staff_User > Browser: Open one patient and date
Browser > GAS_API: acquireLogLock with patient key and date
GAS_API > Session_Cache: Store or inspect 90-second courtesy lock
GAS_API > Browser: Return lock owner or availability

loop [label: "While the calculator remains open"] {
  Browser > GAS_API: Refresh courtesy lock every 45 seconds
  GAS_API > Session_Cache: Extend lock TTL
}

Staff_User > Browser: Submit corrected daily nutrition entry
Browser > GAS_API: updateDailyNutrition with entryId and expectedLastModified
GAS_API > Session_Cache: Verify session and role
GAS_API > Staff_Sheet: Recheck active and forced-change state
GAS_API > Daily_Log: Find entryId and compare lastModified

alt [label: "Version matches"] {
  GAS_API > Daily_Log: Write updated row and new lastModified
  GAS_API > Browser: Return success and new lastModified
  Browser > Staff_User: Show saved state
}
else [label: "Another device changed the row"] {
  GAS_API > Browser: Return conflict and current editor metadata
  Browser > Staff_User: Show conflict warning without overwriting
}

Browser > GAS_API: releaseLogLock
GAS_API > Session_Cache: Remove courtesy lock

